sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant W as Writer
    participant H as Handler
    participant M as webhook Manager
    participant R as Redis
    participant K as Worker
    W->>H: POST append — durable write
    Note over H: Store.Append returns committed
    H->>M: OnStreamAppend(path) · manager.go:537
    Note over M: bounded enqueue or coalesce<br/>no Redis call
    M-->>H: enqueue outcome
    H-->>W: unchanged append response
    Note over M,R: Manager-owned worker runs asynchronously
    M->>R: occupied slots + fanout sets · redis_store.go:520
    M->>R: GetMany state + links · TailOffsets distinct paths
    Note over M: pure idle-and-pending decision
    Note over M: issueWake · ArmWake increments generation · manager.go:814
    M->>R: ArmWake · gen++ · phase waking · arm_wake.lua
    alt webhook delivery
        M->>K: signed POST · Ed25519 · SSRF guarded
        K-->>M: 200 done:true
        M->>R: Ack · fence on generation + wake_id · advance cursor
    else pull-wake delivery
        M->>R: append wake event to wake stream
        K->>M: claim — lease compare-and-set · claim.lua
        M-->>K: 200 · token + snapshot
        K->>M: ack done:true
    end
    Note over M,R: eager recovery handles errors and overflow<br/>periodic recovery floor is 30 seconds
